# graphify: extra excludes for the knowledge graph (gitignore syntax).
# graphify already honours .gitignore (target/, node_modules/, dist/, …).
# This file additionally drops CHECKED-IN vendored third-party trees that add
# huge graph mass but no understanding of the FastTrackStudio domain — so the
# god-nodes/communities reflect OUR code, not Eigen internals.
# Additive only: a .graphifyignore can exclude more, never re-include.
# Rebuild after editing: `just graph` (runs `graphify update . --force`).

# Vendored NAM upstream (Eigen + nlohmann C++ amp-modeler core). Keep the
# first-party Rust wrapper in libs/neural-amp-modeler/src/ — only the vendored
# C++ engine is dropped.
libs/neural-amp-modeler/NeuralAmpModelerCore/

# All vendored subtrees, wherever they sit: libs/vendor (styx-format),
# libs/editor/vendor (mermaid renderer), apps/task/ui-lab/vendor (vox TS
# runtime), features/task/agent/agent-codex/vendor. `vendor/` matches a
# directory named vendor at any depth (gitignore semantics).
vendor/
